Package: qfdevd
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends},
         iproute2,
         conntrack,
         ieee-data
Description: QuartzFire device/client monitoring daemon
 Aggregates the neighbor table, Kea DHCPv4 leases, and conntrack byte
 accounting into a shared SQLite inventory of the clients seen on the network,
 with best-effort device-type/OS fingerprinting (MAC OUI + DHCP hostname).
 .
 Backs the QuartzFire WebUI's Monitoring - Devices page (a Meraki-style client
 list): online/offline status, best-known identity, last-seen time, per-device
 usage over selectable windows, client type, and IPv4 assignment. The WebUI
 backend reads the same SQLite database (WAL) and owns the user-assigned
 device description.
